WEBVTT

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.940
What are you doing?!

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.040
Finish 'em off already!

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:53.310
We can't waste time in a dump like this.

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.410
Atori!

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.490
I'm gonna take 'em all at once.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:29.290
Karasu!

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:32.820
I'll take these guys! You get going!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:33.800
But...

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:35.320
Just, shut up!

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.560
Just go and save Haruka!

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:46.080
Get going!

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:46.100
Atori...
Get going!

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.230
Atori...

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:04.060
Karasu, blast Shangri-la into pieces!

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.720
Come to me, Dragon Torque.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:22.830
Come with me to a world of nothingness.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.680
Haruka!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.130
Come with me...

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:40.130
Dragon Torque.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:52.460
What?!

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:58.670
All particles approaching light speed.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:01.400
What is that?

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.930
Is the mountain on fire or something?

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.930
It's dimensional overlap.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:10.410
Critical mass reached.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.960
Generation of theta particles confirmed.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:13.960
Outbreak level in excess of 120%.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:17.390
These numbers are abnormal, how are yours?

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:19.190
Maybe the instruments are malfunctioning.

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:21.940
The computer's calculation speed is plummeting rapidly!

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:23.200
All coordinates lost!

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:27.730
How come?!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.630
Also unable to observe theta particles!

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:32.790
What the hell?! Wasn't everything was going so well until now?

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:35.900
We've been consumed by the critical stage.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:39.680
So what?! They're just particles!

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.110
It's no good. The voltage is dropping!

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:43.480
The magnetic field on the acceleration coil...

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:44.800
We've lost all satellites!

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.640
Professor Mayuzumi...

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.970
This place-site itself is in the process of becoming a quantum state.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.000
Don't screw with me!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.490
Whadda ya mean, quantum state?!

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.950
Soon, all existences will become de-established and...

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:58.380
I said stop it!

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:02.150
It's impossible for a macro world like ours to become a quantum state!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:06.410
That's not all. This may be leading to the worst case scenario.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:08.640
Dimensional convergence?

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:12.790
When you forcefully establish something that's non-established...

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.480
And then what?!

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:15.760
It will disappear.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:19.790
By forcibly merging infinite choices all at once,

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:24.330
A place-site will occur, forcing all the infinite dimensions to converge.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.470
Everything drawn into it,

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.680
will disappear.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.570
What do you mean?

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.400
It's that ring.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:37.170
What's it doing here?

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:38.600
What is that?

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:40.610
Is it a mirage?

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:41.670
Impossible.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.590
I think the center of the ring is starting to glow!

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.440
I see something there!

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:47.680
This is impossible...

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:49.760
Shangri-la?

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.710
Hey! Let's go up the mountain!

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.740
Yeah! We can get a better look from up there.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:54.740
Hurry, hurry!

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:56.490
Hey, where are you lot going?!

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:57.500
Hold on a second!

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.380
Where am I?

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:05.560
Where is this place?

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.400
Haruka...

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:14.430
Yuu...

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.030
That's right.

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:17.540
Old man?

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:22.820
The poor thing. He has chosen that dimension.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:27.320
It is a future full of hate and sorrow.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.010
Future?

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:33.820
Yes. It is one of many futures.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:36.200
What should I do?

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:40.190
What sort of future would you like to see?

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:43.690
I don't want to see a sad future.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:48.470
Dimensions create the existence of infinite choices of future,

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:54.230
so people can imagine better futures.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:56.280
What if there was only one future?

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:59.530
Dimensions without options...

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:02.020
would collapse and expire.

00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:03.890
Would everyone disappear?

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:08.390
Yes. The earth and sky would disappear,

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:10.870
and all would turn into a void.

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.370
What should I do?

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:22.040
You were chosen from all the dimensions.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.300
Why?

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:27.380
It is quite possible that it didn't have to be you.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.380
But you were chosen.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.760
Am I going to decide?

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:36.310
Listen to all the dimensions.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.990
Listen to the voices of all the living things.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.600
Feel them.

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:45.690
Feel... everything?

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.370
No! You people cannot go underground!

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:54.550
Stand back!

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:55.710
Save us!

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:57.170
I don't want to disappear!

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:02.670
It's the end!

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:04.850
It's the end of the world!

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:07.770
Everything's gonna disappear!

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.080
Lily, open the door! Lily!

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:16.850
Auntie.

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:19.060
Go get your mother, Lily.

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.190
Everything's gonna disappear, right?

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.930
We don't know that for sure, let's go up to the surface.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:24.920
Huh?

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:28.110
We all have to look at this world.

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:32.960
Without a flinch, we have to look at our world once again.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:36.920
Then we will definitely be able recognize our world.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:44.290
You're late, Ai. Where have you been?

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.920
Ai, Sara says that supper's ready.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:50.360
Welcome back, big brother!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.700
Sara!

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:56.360
Damn. I ain't gonna disappear just yet!

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.490
Definitely!

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:04.980
Is it hopeless?

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:07.540
Will the dimensions be swallowed up by Shangri-la?

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:09.910
There should still be a way.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:12.970
Take this.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.810
You return to La'cryma.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.240
The storage battery... It's too late to return to La'cryma.

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:23.620
All dimensions are being drawn into the tide of Shangri-la's causality.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.370
Causality...

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:28.480
If we manage to oppose it,

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:32.340
we may be able to push back the tide
of the omni-dimensional integration.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:33.960
Push back?

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.900
You mean, destroy the REIZU simulator?

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:39.370
That's right.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.810
The existence descriptive data for the world of La'cryma will be lost!

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:42.930
No, it won't.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:47.110
It's useless to create a virtual observer using the REIZU system.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.790
To establish existence, the most vital aspect

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:53.660
is for people to observe one another and acknowledge them.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:57.860
If people can recognize and understand one another,

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.450
existence can be established.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:01.420
Tobi...

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:06.210
I realized it when I came to this dimension and met Haruka.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:12.040
That people can become established by
having their existence recognized.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.890
Let me through a second! S'cuse me!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.280
The light's brighter!

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:25.310
You're right.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.780
Haruka is in there, right?

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:29.350
Hey, look!

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:30.130
Huh?

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.630
Those things are impossible.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.760
Haruka will come home, won't she?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.620
Of course she will!

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.230
She's got Atori and Karasu with her.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:09.270
That's right. She'll come back with Yuu.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.270
I believe that.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.210
The Ouroboros.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:21.980
Huh?

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:27.250
It's so pretty... I wish you could see it, Mommy.

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:30.220
What do you see, Lily?

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:33.790
There's this huge ring floating in the sky.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:36.320
And you can see pretty scenery inside it.

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:49.620
I guess this place is abandoned now.

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:52.100
What is that?

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:02.340
The dimensions have linked up.

00:11:08.670 --> 00:11:11.000
A lot of things are flying this way!

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.470
Impossible!

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:13.110
What?!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.340
They're looking right at us!

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:26.770
What's that?

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:28.940
It looks really tough.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:29.830
Atori!

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:32.250
That's Atori!

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.120
Atori is protecting us!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.570
You?

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:41.210
I now have the power of the Dragon Torque.

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:46.860
The dimensions are now on their way towards integration.

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:48.620
Why, you...

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:53.820
It has all begun...

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:57.770
and now, it will end.

00:12:58.010 --> 00:13:00.580
Isn't that what you wish for?

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:03.420
Because you are me.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:09.850
You understand, don't you?

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:13.660
You can understand my sorrow, and rage!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.290
People are fools.

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:19.250
I wish I had never come to know...

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:21.820
the meaning of existence!

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:34.080
Damn. You creep me out!

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:47.190
All of you swarming like flies really creeps me out!

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.400
First and Second systems cannot reboot!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:57.600
Third system is also down!

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:59.490
What's going on here?

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:02.520
But the particles are continuing to accelerate.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.900
Why don't you try rebooting?

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.370
What is this?!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:09.610
Why are there two of me?!

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:12.100
Hey, this isn't real, right?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.690
The dimensions are converging.

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:15.980
Dimensions?!

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:17.690
What is this?

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:22.130
Uchida-chan, is this also the doing of the so called dimension?

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:23.910
Kooriyama-san?

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:29.280
Is that me?

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:30.750
It's "Chaos."

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:35.450
Another me, this is a harsh joke...

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:42.510
So this is what you meant about rolling snake eyes?

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:53.430
So, I guess there's a me that can't be shot.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:55.040
Why, you!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.360
Wh... What're you doing?!

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:00.060
Just shut the hell up!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:08.300
It looks like there isn't a you that I can't hit.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.930
Kooriyama-san.

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:13.390
It'll take more than whacking Shinohara-kun to get us out of this.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.640
Yeah.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:17.290
There is still a way.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:19.320
Don't give up.

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:21.680
Tobi-kun!

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:32.670
Atori, he's...

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:35.570
He's stopping those guys from coming out of the ring.

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:37.550
Atori, you're amazing.

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:45.300
I think that I was happy in every dimension.

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:48.510
Because I met you...

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:52.870
I'm happy.

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:57.850
You're not like Karasu.

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:00.360
You've forgotten, haven't you.

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:03.850
I have not forgotten!

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:07.760
I can still remember the flames as clearly as yesterday.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.800
I have not forgotten the sadness that I felt.

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:19.100
No. You have Yuu's memories,

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:21.980
but you've forgotten me, haven't you?

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:25.720
Haruka...

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.560
I think I like it here better than Tokyo after all.

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.310
I feel more relaxed here.

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:38.470
It's been almost four years since you died.

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:40.480
Time sure flies.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:44.880
The Haruka of this dimension is no longer here either.

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:47.960
But Yuu... didn't forget me.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.150
No...

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:52.480
I have not forgotten you.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.470
You are not like Karasu.

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:55.970
I...

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:58.550
You have forgotten me...

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.240
Stop this now.

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:04.020
Stop obliterating everything.

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:10.970
You pieces of filth!

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:16.530
You people ran away from the pain of life!

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:21.010
You can rot away in your imaginary paradise!

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:24.370
We must oppose the tide, even if we're the only dimension to do it!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:28.770
We must stop the Magic Circle and pull out of the quantum state!

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:32.760
Tobi-kun, I've booted up the backup computer.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.010
Uchida-san.

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:37.890
I know. When the Magic Circle disappears

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:40.750
I will observe the Kooriyama-san who wasn't shot,

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:41.990
and establish him.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:46.980
It'll be fine. God will give me a good roll of dice.

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:02.140
I won't let the future happen!

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:05.040
It's time!

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:09.040
The program is running!

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:12.540
Mayuzumi-san.

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:14.050
Emergency shutdown!

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:42.280
This can't be!

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.850
Is it you?

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:55.840
You can't possibly hope to oppose me.

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:58.800
Because you are me.

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:01.010
I am not you.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:06.830
How? The dimensions should be converged now.

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:09.020
I saw your past.

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:13.550
Perhaps I was your past.

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:17.360
But the you right now, is not me!

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:21.040
If I were you, I wouldn't have forgotten about Haruka!

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.850
I wouldn't have killed Isami either.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:26.120
You are me.

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:27.310
I am not!

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.120
You are not me!

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:32.120
I will never become you.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:34.210
I will not give up on the future!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:39.080
Your existence is not established.

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:41.800
You are the illusion!

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.700
Illusion?

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:49.000
Come here, Haruka, let's go home together.

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:55.140
Yuu...

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:16.560
The Ouroboros is fading.

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:31.900
Atori...

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:45.500
Snow?

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:47.870
Blue snow.

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:51.070
Impossible.

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:53.840
It's snowing blue snow.

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:56.640
Atori...

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:00.580
It sure is pretty.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:17.810
Kooriyama-san!

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:19.320
Thank God!

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:21.360
Hey, come on, Uchida-chan!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:25.370
Was the dimensional convergence averted?

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:26.760
Mayuzumi-san...

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:29.060
It's all right now.

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:32.390
The balance of every dimension is being maintained.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:34.420
Tobi-kun...

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:37.790
I hope that the future of this dimension...

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:41.130
is a happy one.

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:48.620
Tobi-kun, Kooriyama-san is back to normal...

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:51.360
Tobi-kun?

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:55.640
Who am I?

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:02.320
Didn't anyone recognize me?

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:09.050
My existence won't be established?

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:18.410
The time of assembly has ended.

00:22:18.630 --> 00:22:20.880
The place-site of selection has been revived.

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:23.790
Recognition has been restored.

00:22:24.620 --> 00:22:29.030
You can't possibly have a choice in this.

00:22:35.550 --> 00:22:39.000
You will all come back...

00:22:40.270 --> 00:22:42.310
to this dimension.

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:56.920
Where am I?

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:00.400
The dimensional horizon.

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:02.240
Karasu.

00:23:03.030 --> 00:23:04.790
The dimensions are restored.

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:07.880
The future has gained infinite choice.

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:11.220
So, the future is not decided, right?

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:12.920
That's right, Haruka.

00:23:13.820 --> 00:23:15.390
Thank goodness.

00:23:19.990 --> 00:23:21.750
Aren't you gonna stay with me?

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:29.600
I am always with you, I swear.

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:32.860
Will I see you again?

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:34.960
In 15 years.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:36.940
Because you're Yuu?

00:23:37.310 --> 00:23:38.060
Yes.

00:23:43.710 --> 00:23:44.790
Haruka?

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:47.080
Hey! I heard Haruka's voice!

00:23:47.120 --> 00:23:49.590
I heard it too. She said she's with Yuu.

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:52.150
Hey, blue snow!

00:23:59.530 --> 00:24:00.730
Haruka...

00:24:00.770 --> 00:24:02.510
Yuu, I...

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:04.250
Haruka!

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:05.080
Yuu!

00:24:05.120 --> 00:24:06.510
Haruka!

00:24:07.100 --> 00:24:07.730
Yuu! This is impossible!

00:24:07.730 --> 00:24:09.420
Haruka, you're all right!

00:24:09.420 --> 00:24:11.590
I'm so glad, I'm so glad!
Impossible! Totally, unbelievably impossible!

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:12.780
Impossible! Totally, unbelievably impossible!

00:24:12.920 --> 00:24:15.320
Isami, it's all right.

00:24:26.160 --> 00:24:29.180
Haruka, is Goto coming back home from Tokyo?

00:24:29.180 --> 00:24:30.070
It looks that way.

00:24:30.070 --> 00:24:33.660
Good for you... It's been a long time for you, Haruka.

00:24:33.660 --> 00:24:35.030
But we exchange e-mails.

00:24:35.030 --> 00:24:38.250
All right, I'll contact Fujiwara, and we'll all have a party!

00:24:38.250 --> 00:24:39.650
You sure look happy about that, Ai.

00:24:41.090 --> 00:24:43.360
I'm just going to swing by the church.

00:24:43.510 --> 00:24:45.030
Oh, okay. See ya, Haruka.

00:24:45.030 --> 00:24:45.910
Bye bye!

00:24:54.420 --> 00:24:55.510
Karasu...

00:24:58.240 --> 00:25:01.980
Yuu will be back soon.
